'''Wyvern''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] grants it improved health and additional abilities such as [[Weaken]], [[Immune to Slow]], and [[Colossus Slayer]].

